OL,3,GNEWSAHow will Manchester Pride be
OL,4,Adifferent this year?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe August bank holiday weekend has
OL,7,Fbeen home to Manchester Pride for more
OL,8,Fthan 40 years.
OL,10,FFrom its humble beginnings in 1985 as a
OL,11,Ffundraiser for Monsall Hospital's HIV
OL,12,Fand Aids ward, Manchester Pride grew
OL,13,Finto one of the country's biggest
OL,14,FLGBTQ+ events.
OL,16,FWhen the company behind it went into
OL,17,Fvoluntary liquidation last year, many
OL,18,Fwere worried there would be no Pride in
OL,19,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,410,400,260,160,0,100
