OL,3,GNEWSAHow will Manchester Pride be
OL,4,Adifferent this year?
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Manchester City Council tried to
OL,7,Fallay fears when, in January, it
OL,8,Fannounced that a new not-for-profit
OL,9,Fcommunity interest company (CIC),
OL,10,FManchester Village Pride, would take
OL,11,Fover the running of the four-day event.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
